==Symptoms==

*Not turning on.
*Pulling 120 mA from the charge port.

==Solution==
Cause:

* Spillage
* Corrosion on keyboard backlight connector
* Short to ground via keyboard backlight connector

'''[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r2HyzGwH7Z0 Fixed by removing keyboard backlight connector. Replace with new keyboard backlight connector.]'''